<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><div><div class="crumb"><a href="../">Products</a> / Power Transformer</div><span class="kicker">Power Transformer</span><h1>Silicon Steel Core Transformer</h1><p>Silicon Steel Core Transformer is part of the Apex Power Transformer portfolio, designed for international power distribution and EV charging infrastructure projects. It can be configured according to project voltage, capacity, installation environment, technical standard, and OEM/ODM requirements.</p><a class="btn btn-orange" href="#rfq">Request Technical Datasheet</a><a class="btn btn-white" href="../" style="margin-left:10px">Back to Products</a></div><div class="hero-img"><img src="../../assets/oil-transformer.jpg" alt="Silicon Steel Core Transformer"></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Overview</span><h2>Product Overview</h2><p class="lead">Silicon Steel Core Transformer is part of the Apex Power Transformer portfolio, designed for international power distribution and EV charging infrastructure projects. It can be configured according to project voltage, capacity, installation environment, technical standard, and OEM/ODM requirements.</p></div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Key Benefits</span><h2>Why Choose This Product</h2><div class="grid grid-3"><div class='card'><h3>Project-Based Configuration</h3><p>Technical parameters can be adapted according to voltage, capacity, charging power, site layout, and target market.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Grid-to-Plug Compatibility</h3><p>Designed to fit Apex's integrated architecture from power distribution to EV charging control.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>OEM / ODM Support</h3><p>Appearance, labeling, interface, protocol, and configuration can be customized for long-term partners.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Export-Oriented Support</h3><p>Datasheets, technical communication, packing, and project documentation can be supported for overseas customers.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>System Integration</h3><p>Can be matched with other Apex products such as transformers, substations, switchgear, chargers, and controllers.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>B2B Project Focus</h3><p>Suitable for EPC contractors, distributors, charging station operators, industrial clients, and OEM equipment brands.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Technical Parameters</span><h2>Specification Reference</h2><p class="lead">Final specifications can be customized according to project technical requirements.</p><table style="margin-top:24px"><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Reference Information</th></tr><tr><td>Phase</td><td>Three-phase</td></tr>
<tr><td>Frequency</td><td>50Hz / 60Hz</td></tr>
<tr><td>Voltage</td><td>10kV / 35kV / project-based voltage configuration</td></tr>
<tr><td>Capacity</td><td>Project-based selection according to power requirement</td></tr>
<tr><td>Core Material</td><td>Silicon steel or amorphous alloy depending on model</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Oil-immersed or dry-type cooling configuration</td></tr>
<tr><td>Customization</td><td>Voltage, capacity, winding material, vector group, impedance, accessories</td></tr></table></div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Applications</span><h2>Typical Applications</h2><div class="applications"><span>Utility distribution</span><span>Industrial plants</span><span>Commercial buildings</span><span>Renewable energy projects</span><span>Substations</span><span>EV charging infrastructure</span></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><span class="kicker">FAQ</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>What information is needed for a Silicon Steel Core Transformer quotation?</summary><p>Please provide project country, voltage, capacity or power rating, quantity, installation environment, technical drawings if available, and customization requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Can Apex customize this product?</summary><p>Yes. Apex supports project-based configuration and OEM/ODM cooperation according to technical and branding requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Can this product be combined with other Apex equipment?</summary><p>Yes. Apex can help match this product with transformers, substations, switchgear, chargers, and controllers depending on your Grid-to-Plug project architecture.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="container"><div class="rfq" id="rfq"><div><span class="kicker" style="color:#9cefff">Product RFQ</span><h2>Request Configuration for Silicon Steel Core Transformer</h2><p>Send technical requirements, drawings, project country, voltage, capacity, power rating, protocol, quantity, and customization needs.</p></div><form><div class="form-grid"><input placeholder="Name"><input placeholder="Email"><input placeholder="Company"><input placeholder="Country"><select class="full"><option>Silicon Steel Core Transformer</option><option>Oil-Immersed Transformer</option><option>Dry-Type Transformer</option><option>Silicon Steel Core Transformer</option><option>Amorphous Alloy Transformer</option><option>10kV Box-Type Substation</option><option>EV Charging Substation Solution</option><option>Solar Compact Substation</option><option>KYN28-12 MV Switchgear</option><option>GCS LV Drawer-Type Switchgear</option><option>GGD LV Distribution Cabinet</option><option>XL LV Power Cabinet</option><option>7kW Single-Gun AC Charging Pile</option><option>40kW Single-Gun Integrated DC Charging Pile</option><option>160kW / 400kW Integrated DC Dual-Gun Charging Pile</option><option>400kW Heavy-Duty Truck DC Charger</option><option>480kW Fully Flexible Group Charging Pile</option><option>Apex JC-6512 Industrial EV DC Charging Station Controller</option><option>Apex JC-6513 Intelligent EV Charging Hub Controller</option><option>JC-6650 AC EV Charging Station Controller</option><option>Apex JC-6620 OCPP Protocol Conversion Board</option><option>JC-1301 CHAdeMO Protocol Converter Board</option></select><input placeholder="Voltage / Capacity / Power"><input placeholder="Quantity"><textarea placeholder="Technical requirements or project description"></textarea><button class="btn btn-orange full" type="button">Submit RFQ</button></div></form></div></div></section>
